╭ Arch Linux / CachyOS setup ──────────╮╭ Details ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│   1 Run automatic setup              ││Set up data partition                                                                             │
│❯  2 Set up data partition            ││                                                                                                  │
│   3 Add kud3n's repository           ││Pick any internal or external partition (NTFS, exFAT, FAT, ext4, btrfs, XFS), see the exact       │
│   4 Install packages                 ││/etc/fstab line, test-mount it, then install the line and mount it. Optionally moves home folders │
│   5 Set up services                  ││onto it, leaving symlinks. Undo puts everything back.                                             │
│   6 Import data                      ││                                                                                                  │
│   7 Export data                      ││Changes:    /etc/fstab (backup kept), the mount point, optionally your home folders and           │
│   8 App status                       ││~/.config/user-dirs.dirs                                                                          │
│   9 Inspect a backup                 ││Needs root: yes (kast already runs as root)                                                       │
│   p KDE Plasma settings              ││Automatic:  Optional step of the automatic run (off by default; you pick the partition while      │
│   s Scheduled backup                 ││configuring).                                                                                     │
│   u Undo changes                     ││                                                                                                  │
│   x Uninstall apps                   ││                                                                                                  │
│   q Quit                             ││                                                                                                  │
